### 5.6 WebTorrent Historical Data Distribution

**Source File Location:** Lines ~2550-2650 of v23.5 artifact

**Architecture:** The WebTorrent client operates in the browser using WebRTC for peer-to-peer data transfer. Users input a magnet link; the torrent client downloads file pieces from the swarm while simultaneously uploading to other peers.

